        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Mookychick, BUST\n- Topics: feminist media, online communities, sociopolitical and cultural coverage\n\nFacts:\n- Mookychick is an independent daily online magazine and community.\n- Mookychick has more than 100,000 readers a month and over 5,000 forum members.\n- Mookychick covers current sociopolitical events, social and cultural trends, alternative fashion, movies, books, electronica, and arts and crafts from a feminist perspective.\n- BUST is a feminist publication and community contrasted with Mookychick.\n- BUST is a women's lifestyle magazine that is published six times a year.\n- Debbie Stoller and Laurie Henzel publish BUST.",
